      "content": "It sounds like you are trapped in a cycle of self-blame, believing that your pain is a flaw you must erase for their sake. But the deepest act of love is not in disappearing; it's in finding the strength to manage your own pain so you can be present for them. Your child needs *you*, even the struggling version of you, because you are their foundation. Please, before making any irreversible decisions, give yourself one more chance to talk to someone who can help you carry this load.",
      "source": "target",
